  "Description": "Reads a matrix (as an array of four Vector4 rows) from the evaluation context.\n\nIf the variable is undefined or not a matrix, the identity matrix is returned. This is used internally for passing transform matrices between render passes, e.g. for rendering shadow maps.\n\nSee also: [SetMatrixVar]",
